"盘屿会只读检查“%@”上全部文件和文件夹的记录，没有发现问题才清除“需要检查”标记，随后开启读写；发现问题则不做任何修改。这不等同于 Windows 的完整磁盘检查：如果盘里有重要且没有备份的数据，建议优先在 Windows 中检查。检查期间磁盘会暂时卸载，文件较多时需要几分钟。" = "Volisle reads the records of every file and folder on “%@” without changing anything. Only if no problems are found does it clear the “needs a check” mark and turn on write access; if it finds a problem, nothing is changed. This isn’t the same as a full disk check in Windows: if the disk holds important data without a backup, check it in Windows first. The disk is unmounted during the check, which can take a few minutes on disks with many files.";
