"已解锁，可读写：可以在 Finder 中拷贝、修改和删除文件。拔线前请先点“锁定”或在 Finder 中推出。锁定后需要再次输入密码。" = "Unlocked, read-write: you can copy, change and delete files in Finder. Before unplugging, click Lock or eject it in Finder. After locking, you’ll need the password again.";
