"盘屿的文件系统扩展没有为这块盘开启写入，磁盘保持只读，数据不受影响。请确认磁盘或读卡器的写保护开关没有锁上；如果这块盘上次写入时被直接拔掉，请接回 Windows 打开一次，安全弹出后再插回。" = "Volisle’s file system extension didn’t turn on writing for this disk, so it stays read-only and your data isn’t affected. Make sure the write-protect switch on the disk or card reader isn’t locked. If the disk was unplugged while writing last time, connect it to Windows, open it once, eject it safely, and connect it again.";
"按顺序打开下面三项，每项设置一次即可。打开后会自动打勾。" = "Turn these on in order; each needs setting only once. Each one ticks itself when it’s on.";
